        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "[V2G20-5027] After sending a WPT_FinePositioningReq with EVProcessing set to \"Finished\", and receiving the next response message with \"ResponseCode = OK\", the EVCC shall send a WPT_PairingReq within V2G_EVCC_Sequence_Performance_Timeout according to Table 218.",
